Hi <%= @resource.username.presence || @resource.email %>,

Someone asked to reset the password for your ReelScore account. Open this link to choose a new one:

<%= edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %>

This link works once and expires in <%= Devise.reset_password_within.inspect %>. If you didn't ask for this, ignore this email and your password won't change.
